The Measurement guarantee is a paid option, offered in the cart on pieces sold online whose measurements or size you give yourself (railings, backlit ceilings, tables). It is never added automatically: you tick it piece by piece, before paying. It is not offered when the order includes the home measuring visit (the workshop measures itself) or fitting by the workshop.

Why it exists. A piece made to your measurements carries no right of withdrawal (article L221-28 3° of the French Consumer Code, see article 7). If your measurements were wrong, the piece would not fit, without being defective. The Measurement guarantee covers that risk.

What it covers. For each guaranteed piece: one single alteration or remake of the piece, to the corrected measurements you give us.

How it works:
– you write to us (e-mail to auboiacier@gmail.com, or post) within 15 days of delivery or collection of the piece, giving your new measurements;
– the piece has not been fitted, drilled, cut or damaged; you send it back in its packaging, or bring it back to the workshop in Saumur;
– sending the piece back to the workshop is at your expense;
– shipping the corrected piece back to you is free, within mainland France, by the same delivery method as the order;
– the new measurements stay within the limits shown on the piece's page;
– if the piece at the new measurements costs more, only the price difference is due; if it costs less, nothing is refunded;
– the corrected piece follows the normal production time shown on its page, from receipt of the piece and the new measurements.

What it does not cover (exclusions): a change of mind about the model, the wood, the colour or the finish; damage caused by fitting, or by transport when the piece is sent back; pieces sold on quotation whose measurements the workshop took itself (staircase, glazed partition, sculpture…); one-size pieces (chair, armchair).

Price: {garantiePct} of the price of the piece (options included), rounded up to the next euro, at least {garantieMin} and at most {garantieMax} per piece. The exact price is shown next to the box in the cart, then on a separate line of the order and the invoice.

Duration: 15 days from delivery (or collection from the workshop) of the piece.

Territory: mainland France.

Guarantor: Auboiacier, metalwork workshop in Saumur (Maine-et-Loire, France) — identity, address and identifiers in the legal notice and below; e-mail: auboiacier@gmail.com.

Your legal rights remain in full. The Measurement guarantee applies without prejudice to the consumer's right to benefit from the legal warranty of conformity, under the conditions set out in articles L217-3 et seq. of the French Consumer Code, and from the warranty against hidden defects, under the conditions set out in articles 1641 to 1649 of the French Civil Code. It applies in addition to the rights you enjoy under the legal warranty of conformity, for the whole of its duration, and does not replace them: it covers a mistake in your measurements, which the legal warranties do not cover; a defect in the piece is always covered, free of charge, by the legal warranties (article 8). The official box on the legal warranty of conformity and hidden defects, reproduced at the end of these terms, forms part of this contract.
